    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "The 30th term.",
      "worked": "$a=15$, $d=9$.\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=a+(n-1)d\\\\276&=15+(n-1)9\\\\261&=9(n-1)\\\\29&=n-1\\\\n&=30\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $276$ is the 30th term.",
